    {
      "id": "be-s12m-monopoly-c3",
      "heading": "Worked example: P = 10 - Q",
      "explanation_md": "Given **P = 10 - Q** and **C(Q) = 6 + 2Q**:\n\n- **MR = 10 - 2Q**, **MC = 2**\n- 10 - 2Q = 2, so **Q = 4 units**\n- **P = 10 - 4 = $6**\n- Profit = (6)(4) - (6 + 8) = **$10**",
      "example_ids": [
        "be-ex-monopoly-10-q"
      ],
      "key_terms": [],
